Join the global Arm AI Developer Challenge

Hi Nayan,&nbsp;
  &nbsp;
  The Arm AI Developer Challenge 2025 is live on Devpost! Build an AI project that runs natively on Arm-powered devices and push the boundaries of what’s possible.
  &nbsp;
  &#128198; Submissions deadline: December 3, 2025
  &#128176; Total prize pool: $15,000
  &#127757; Open worldwide (eligibility restrictions apply)

Enter the challenge https://goto.arm.com/NDc5LVpZVy05MDcAAAGd7ocdXWUvaKprVbQjDTF3wLXQyp2kFaCXOw_yinou3FBCYtTfZebT7EhyQGQCP_a_08yVLhc=





