Arm neural technology and getting started with Neural Super Sampling﻿.

[ Logo of the semiconductor and software design company, arm. ] https://goto.arm.com/NDc5LVpZVy05MDcAAAGcbCaVUrYdIlXmGmrYHngAhtsJJL-NFexS67uQ22OLKQiBcUYmgbuDl3dJg2wmOW6oWiY7kWc=
[ Image ]
Resources From SIGGRAPH 2025

At SIGGRAPH 2025, we announced Arm neural technology and shared how developers can get started with Neural Super Sampling. Here are the resources to get you up to speed and start working with neural graphics.

Experiment With Neural Technology https://goto.arm.com/NDc5LVpZVy05MDcAAAGcbCaVUnzXdFXfs03wB6mAw85jl1jtMeCEOswYmeKAFpWcK2P7Z5g7S0fyO7yGFn260S3Nhww=
&#128227; Arm Neural Technology Announcement:&nbsp;Bringing neural graphics to mobile for the first time. Read news blog.&nbsp;

&#128279; Start Experimenting With Neural Super Sampling on Mobile: Bring desktop-class visual fidelity to your mobile games, powered by dedicated neural accelerators. Read tech blog.

&#128279; How Neural Super Sampling Works: A deep dive into a practical, ML-powered approach to temporal super sampling including architecture, training, and inference.&nbsp;Read tech blog.&nbsp;

&#128736; Neural Graphics Development Kit: Get started now with our open Neural Graphics Development Kit, featuring Unreal Engine plugins, sample code, documentation, an emulation platform, and an upsampling model. Access kit.&nbsp;

&#129309; Arm Developer Program: Connect with a global community of experts and access essential tools, insights, and resources. Join the community.&nbsp;






Sign up for Arm Updates
  &nbsp;


