SME2 Brings Real-Time AI&nbsp;
  to the Edge

Google's Gemma 3 runs up to 6x faster on the same device when Arm's Scalable Matrix Extensions 2 (SME2) is enabled.
  &nbsp;
  With SME2 acceleration, Gemma 3 can also start text summarization of up to 800 words in under one second.
  &nbsp;
  Available now on iOS and coming to Android, SME2 helps you push real-time AI to the edge without code rewrites.&nbsp;

SME2 Benefits https://goto.arm.com/NDc5LVpZVy05MDcAAAGbmJD4Xm5fB-pvUaujnOoF8HDJwYaGSLaxGHJafn87-TYLSXwkH7Zlg8BjCQBazattRNnDM24dqIRdFB0=
